{"description":"The user switches places with a party Pokémon in waiting and passes along any stat changes.","effect":"User switches out, and the trainer selects a replacement Pokémon from the party. Stat changes, confusion, and persistent move effects are passed along to the replacement Pokémon.\n\nThe following move effects are passed:\n\n* Aqua Ring * both the user’s and target’s effect of Block, Mean Look, and Spider Web * the curse effect of Curse * Embargo * Focus Energy or an activated Lansat Berry * Gastro Acid * Ingrain * being sapped by Leech Seed * being targeted by Lock-On or Mind Reader * Magnet Rise * Perish Song’s counter * Power Trick * Substitute; the doll’s HP is unchanged\n\nThe replacement Pokémon does not trigger effects that respond to Pokémon switching in.","learners":{"machine":[[12,128],[35,384],[36,384],[37,256],[38,256],[39,384],[40,384],[48,256],[49,256],[62,256],[78,128],[83,128],[84,256],[85,256],[97,256],[106,256],[107,256],[122,128],[123,384],[133,384],[134,384],[135,384],[136,384],[145,384],[151,384],[161,256],[162,256],[167,256],[168,256],[175,128],[176,128],[177,128],[178,128],[182,384],[187,256],[188,256],[189,256],[190,256],[196,384],[197,384],[203,256],[206,384],[207,256],[212,384],[225,384],[237,256],[251,128],[255,384],[256,384],[257,384],[283,256],[284,256],[291,128],[303,128],[307,256],[308,256],[311,256],[312,256],[313,256],[314,256],[335,256],[337,128],[338,128],[358,256],[359,128],[380,384],[381,384],[385,384],[402,256],[418,256],[419,256],[424,256],[425,384],[426,384],[427,128],[428,128],[433,256],[439,128],[453,384],[454,384],[461,256],[468,128],[470,384],[471,384],[472,256],[480,384],[481,384],[482,384],[489,256],[490,256],[492,256],[494,128],[509,128],[510,128],[522,256],[523,256],[527,128],[528,128],[540,256],[541,256],[542,256],[545,128],[572,256],[573,256],[585,256],[586,256],[587,128],[594,256],[616,128],[617,128],[619,384],[620,384],[632,128],[647,256],[648,256],[669,256],[670,256],[671,256],[678,256],[686,384],[